    "description": "Closed Mentalism 3.6 - Sense Mastery. Spells for enhancing hearing, sight (night/side/water/fog/dark vision), smell and touch, detecting and dispelling illusions, remote sensing (Mentalist Ear/Eye), and merging senses with a known subject.",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "01. Sly Ears",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 1,
          "area_of_effect": "caster",
          "duration": "10 min/lvl",
          "range": "self",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster gains double normal hearing. This results in a special bonus of +50 to Awareness/Searching and Awareness/Senses skills involving only hearing (or +5 for Alertness skill). This bonus is +25 to such skills involving hearing and other senses (or +3 for Alertness skill)."
        }
      },
      {
